    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# Resource Allocation Evaluation\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Business Process Optimization\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"> This notebook evaluates resource allocation methods under controlled simulator settings. The only intended experimental change is the allocation method itself.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 3,\n",
    "   \"id\": \"167f24a3\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"import sys\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import platform\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from pathlib import Path\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import numpy as np\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import pandas as pd\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import seaborn as sns\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"61ef6653\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Evaluation Scope and Basic Metrics\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"This notebook first evaluates the three basic comparison metrics:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| # | Metric | Definition |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|---|--------|------------|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| 1 | **Average Cycle Time** | Mean case duration from first to last event. |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| 2 | **Average Resource Occupation** | Mean ratio of working time to scheduled available time per resource. |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| 3 | **Resource Fairness (MAD / weighted MAD)** | Deviation of resource occupations from their mean; lower values mean a more balanced workload. |\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"2215760d\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Simulation Settings\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"This section fixes the experimental setup. Only the **resource allocation method** changes between runs.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Process Model\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Setting | Value |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|---|---|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Model file | `data/process_model.bpmn` |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Format | BPMN 2.0 (loaded via `sim_core/bpmn_io.py` and converted internally to a Petri net) |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Activities | Loan-application process with work activities and automatic tasks |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"The same process model is used for all methods.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Spawn / Arrival Model\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Setting | Value |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|---|---|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Spawner class | `AdvancedSpawner` (`spawn_rates/advanced_spawner.py`) |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Arrival profile | Time-varying rate table derived from the event log |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Holiday calendar | Netherlands public holidays |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Max cases | 31 509 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"The same arrival model is used for all methods.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Decision / Routing Rules\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Setting | Value |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|---|---|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Manager class | `DPManager` (`decision_analysis/DPManager.py`) |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Mode | `\\\"basic\\\"` |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Rules file | `decision_analysis/decision_prob_rules.json` |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"The same routing rules are used for all methods.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Processing-Time Model\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Setting | Value |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|---|---|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Sampler class | `ProcessingTimeSampler` (`processing_times/sampling.py`) |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Model type | Distribution-based per activity |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Files | `processing_times/Basic_Models/processing_models_proc.json` |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| | `processing_times/Basic_Models/processing_models_full_dur.json` |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| | `processing_times/Basic_Models/wait_reference.json` |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| QR flag | `pt_use_qr=True` |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Fallback | 60 seconds |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"The same processing-time model is used for all methods.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Resource Availability\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Setting | Value |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|---|---|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Availability file | `resources/availabilities/availabilities_advanced.csv` |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Schedule type | Shift-based |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Permissions file | `resources/permissions/role_permissions.csv` |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Resources can only be assigned when they are on shift, not on break, and permitted for the activity.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Simulation Horizon and Replications\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Setting | Value |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|---|---|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Simulation start | 2016-05-17 09:15:00 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Simulation end | 2016-05-31 09:15:00 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Horizon | **14 calendar days** |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Number of replications | **5 per method** |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Total planned runs | **30** |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Max-events safety cap | 2 000 000 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Every method is evaluated on the same fixed simulation window.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Seed Strategy\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Seeds are computed as:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```\\n\",\n",
    "    \"seed = 1000 × (method_index + 1) + run_index\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Method | method_index | Seeds used |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|---|---|---|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| `random` | 0 | 1000, 1001, 1002, 1003, 1004 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| `round_robin` | 1 | 2000, 2001, 2002, 2003, 2004 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| `shortest_queue` | 2 | 3000, 3001, 3002, 3003, 3004 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| `batch_k5` | 3 | 4000, 4001, 4002, 4003, 4004 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| `advanced_local` | 4 | 5000, 5001, 5002, 5003, 5004 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| `advanced_global` | 5 | 6000, 6001, 6002, 6003, 6004 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### What Varies vs. What Is Fixed\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Component | Fixed across all runs | Varies |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|---|---|---|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| BPMN / Petri net | ✓ | |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Arrival profile | ✓ | |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Decision / routing rules | ✓ | |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Processing-time model | ✓ | |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Availability / permissions | ✓ | |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Simulation horizon | ✓ | |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Replications per method | ✓ | |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| **Resource allocation method** | | ✓ |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Random seed | | ✓ |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Allocation Method Definitions\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"#### 1. Random (`random`)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Chooses uniformly at random from the eligible resources that are on shift, free, and not on break.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"#### 2. Round Robin (`round_robin`)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Cycles through eligible resources with a global index and assigns the first available one.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"#### 3. Shortest Queue (`shortest_queue`)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Chooses the on-shift resource with the shortest internal queue.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"#### 4. Batching (`batch_k5`)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Queues tasks until 5 are waiting, then flushes the batch and assigns them greedily by projected ready time.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"#### 5. Advanced Local (`advanced_local`)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Uses local cost predictions to choose the best resource for each task.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"#### 6. Advanced Global (`advanced_global`)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Uses a global assignment step to match tasks and resources jointly, including postponement if needed.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"30aa1bb4\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Reproducibility and Notebook Configuration\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"This section fixes random seeds and display settings so plots and tables stay consistent.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
