    "   \"id\": \"8bae38e0\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"`batch_k5` has the lowest mean cycle time at **6.08 h**. It is followed by `random` (**8.24 h**) and `round_robin` (**8.74 h**). `shortest_queue` is at **10.41 h**, `advanced_global` at **12.28 h**, and `advanced_local` is highest at **14.12 h**. This means `batch_k5` is clearly the fastest in this setup, while both advanced methods show substantially longer end-to-end cycle times.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"The advanced global method shows substantially higher variability across replications than the other evaluated approaches, so its average values should be interpreted with additional caution.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
